{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"传道书","commonName":"传道书","title":"传道书","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"4f50543f99f7225fcd6ddfe629f589e05c0655922cd97b07218d4e006aaad07c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又转念，见日光之下所行的一切欺压。看哪，受欺压的流泪，且无人安慰；欺压他们的有势力，也无人安慰他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因此，我赞叹那早已死的死人，胜过那还活着的活人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["并且我以为那未曾生的，就是未见过日光之下恶事的，比这两等人更强。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我又见人为一切的劳碌和各样灵巧的工作就被邻舍嫉妒。这也是虚空，也是捕风。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["愚昧人抱着手，吃自己的肉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["满了一把，得享安静，强如满了两把，劳碌捕风。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我又转念，见日光之下有一件虚空的事："]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["有人孤单无二，无子无兄，竟劳碌不息，眼目也不以钱财为足。他说：「我劳劳碌碌，刻苦自己，不享福乐，到底是为谁呢？」这也是虚空，是极重的劳苦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["两个人总比一个人好，因为二人劳碌同得美好的果效。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["若是跌倒，这人可以扶起他的同伴；若是孤身跌倒，没有别人扶起他来，这人就有祸了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["再者，二人同睡就都暖和，一人独睡怎能暖和呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["有人攻胜孤身一人，若有二人便能敌挡他；三股合成的绳子不容易折断。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["贫穷而有智慧的少年人胜过年老不肯纳谏的愚昧王。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["这人是从监牢中出来作王，在他国中，生来原是贫穷的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我见日光之下一切行动的活人都随从那第二位，就是起来代替老王的少年人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他所治理的众人就是他的百姓，多得无数；在他后来的人尚且不喜悦他。这真是虚空，也是捕风。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}